I walk straight ahead on the boulevard.
There are many people on the street.
Suddenly I hear music.
The music comes from a side street.
A street musician is playing there.
I have a lot of time today.
I want to hear the music.
I go left into the small street.
The music is very beautiful.
I follow the music through two quiet streets.
I keep going straight ahead and then right.
The loud boulevard is far away now.
The crowds of people are no longer there.
All at once the music stops.
The small street is completely quiet now.
I look to the left and to the right.
The buildings here are completely unfamiliar.
I see no signs for the museums.
Where am I?
I do not know the way anymore.
